   "source": [
    "### 12.6 Road prior, seed ensemble and smoothing (ablation on validation)\n",
    "- **Road prior.** Notebook 01 (section 6) found almost no obstacle in the top of the image. `ROAD_TOP_ROW` is learned from the **train masks only**: the rows above it hold less than 1 % of the train anomaly pixels, and their scores are set to the lowest score of the image.\n",
    "- **Seed ensemble.** The chosen feature AE is trained with 3 seeds and the error maps are averaged, which reduces the variance of a single run.\n",
    "- **Smoothing.** Sigma is chosen again on validation, because a feature map is already coarser than a pixel map.\n",
    "\n",
    "Each component is added in turn and kept only if the validation AuPRC rises by more than `KEEP_MARGIN`."
   ]
  },
